# CapyBench hashes files byte-for-byte and records the digest in every result:
# the prompt's sha256 is what proves two models answered the same question, and an
# artifact's sha256 is what proves the published video came from that file. Any
# line-ending conversion would change those digests per platform and quietly break
# both guarantees, so these paths are never touched.
bench/prompt.v*.md -text
bench/results/** -text
